# The data the imported rules run over. Deliberately small: two facts that fire
# the uncle rule and one that fires the supplier rule, so a certificate over the
# imported table has something in it and the derived triples can be named.
@prefix : <http://example.org/family#> .

:john  :hasParent  :sue .
:sue   :hasBrother :bob .
:acme  a           :Supplier .
